  "body": "## Changelog\n* 64ae01dc9909d680e2c3f809f2b4a81e5ab6b935  INS-2846: Prepare pluto for unifying circleci (#614)\n* ac2c42d55d5ff46a1af0f4b15faf3555119eea23 INS-2927: Fix vulnerabilities for pluto (#621)\n* 114c5f469a3e4ac0d559df13364b61f37ff6ac2d Managed by Terraform\n* 5de34fb0f529db53efc9ef3903150313d28493b9 Managed by Terraform\n* c74a4e260fba3e8cab7d5eaebf0a575fdfed6353 Managed by Terraform\n* a480187b790095880bd592e3c5871b94d1d2b020 Managed by Terraform\n* 2949d5cd6dcbb26032d965267cef76601fe5ce5f Managed by Terraform\n\nYou can verify the signatures of both the checksums.txt file and the published docker images using [cosign](https://github.com/sigstore/cosign).\n\n```bash\ncosign verify-blob checksums.txt --bundle=checksums.txt.sigstore.json --key https://artifacts.fairwinds.com/cosign-p256.pub\n```\n\n```bash\ncosign verify us-docker.pkg.dev/fairwinds-ops/oss/pluto:v5.24.4 --key https://artifacts.fairwinds.com/cosign-p256.pub\n```\n\n"
